                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Even before it became law, experts told Congress that it wasn\u2019t a question if the Inflation Reduction Act would stifle innovation and result in fewer cures and treatments for patients, but just how many cures and treatments would never be developed or potentially save the lives of patients.",
