                "text": "As a heart surgeon, I understand how critical it is for Americans to have access to a hospital \u2013 especially in an emergency.   I recently met with @myunionhealth's CEO Steve Holman to discuss what I can do to ensure Hoosier communities have access to quality hospital coverage. https://t.co/Z1c9ELg1lx",
